  "raw_meta_yaml": "context:\n  version: \"0.1.0\"\n  # Avoid tomli issues\n  python_min: \"3.11\"\n\npackage:\n  name: t3d\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://bitbucket.org/gyrokinetics/t3d/get/v${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: 5f18df36243429616724d7eb64212e825e8630162035387a8daa795d33a3316d\n\nbuild:\n  number: 1\n  noarch: python\n  script:\n    # The source tarball has no `.git`, so setuptools_scm cannot infer a version.\n    env:\n      SETUPTOOLS_SCM_PRETEND_VERSION_FOR_T3D: ${{ version }}\n    content: ${{ PYTHON }} -m pip install . -vv --no-deps --no-build-isolation\n  python:\n    entry_points:\n      - t3d = t3d.__main__:main\n      - t3d-plot = t3d.tools.profile_plot:main\n      - t3d-time-plot = t3d.tools.time_plot:main\n      - t3d-vmec-plot = t3d.geometry_models.VMEC:main\n      - t3d-source-sink-plot = t3d.tools.source_sink_plot:main\n      - t3d-extract-input-file = t3d.tools.extract_input_file_from_output:main\n\nrequirements:\n  host:\n    - python ${{ python_min }}.*\n    - pip\n    - setuptools >=61.0\n    - setuptools-scm >=6.2\n  run:\n    - python >=${{ python_min }}\n    - numpy\n    - scipy\n    - matplotlib-base\n    - pandas\n    - pyqt\n    - netcdf4\n    - adios2\n    - termcolor\n    - f90nml\n    - joblib\n    - bpcmp\n\ntests:\n  - python:\n      imports:\n        - t3d\n      # adios2 doesn't install Python metadata\n      pip_check: false\n      python_version:\n        - ${{ python_min }}.*\n        - \"*\"\n  - script:\n      - t3d --help\n      - t3d-plot --help\n      - t3d-time-plot --help\n      - t3d-source-sink-plot --help\n      - t3d-extract-input-file --help\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://bitbucket.org/gyrokinetics/t3d/\n  summary: Trinity3D &mdash; transport solver for modeling macro-scale profile evolution in fusion plasmas\n  description: |\n    Trinity3D (t3d) is a transport solver for modeling macro-scale profile\n    evolution in magnetic-confinement fusion plasmas (tokamaks and stellarators).\n    It couples to a variety of flux models and geometry backends to evolve\n    plasma profiles in time.\n  license: GPL-3.0-or-later\n  license_file: LICENSE\n  repository: https://bitbucket.org/gyrokinetics/t3d/\n  documentation: https://t3d.readthedocs.io/\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - tmqian\n    - matthewfeickert\n",
